# The build context is build-env/base/, and the only thing this image needs
# out of it is the filtered lock build-env/build.sh writes there. Everything
# else is excluded by default rather than by enumeration -- an allow-list
# cannot be outgrown by a file somebody adds later, and this is the same shape
# pkgs/mos-deploy/Dockerfile.dockerignore uses.
*
!images.lock
